                <h2>Hi, I'm Bhadruddin</h2>
                <p1> I'm a Web Developer </p1>
                <p>I am Bhadruddin Ali Shaik, a motivated and detail-oriented Web Developer with a growing expertise in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern web design principles. I am passionate about crafting clean, responsive, and user-friendly websites that deliver excellent user experiences across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.
                
With a strong foundation in front-end development, I have developed multiple-page websites including home, about, contact, and service pages with intuitive layouts and interactive elements. My work reflects a keen eye for design and usability, ensuring websites not only look good but are also functional and accessible.

In addition to core web technologies, I am continuously learning and working with tools and frameworks such as:

Bootstrap for faster and mobile-first design

Responsive design techniques using media queries and flexbox/grid

Basic JavaScript programming for interactivity (such as form validation, dynamic content, and animations)

Git & GitHub for version control and collaboration

I enjoy taking on real-world projects and continuously improving my coding skills. My interest also extends to learning backend basics (such as Node.js and PHP) and understanding how full-stack applications work.

Currently, I am focused on building a strong portfolio that showcases my abilities and preparing myself for opportunities in the field of web development where I can contribute meaningfully to a development team, grow as a professional, and solve challenging problems through code.</p>
